  "typeCharacter": "Fraunces is a soft, oily, generous serif. It is used upright and heavy (semibold at optical display size) for the one huge hero headline and the section heads, always sentence case and never italic. Source Sans 3 carries the leads, the lists and the hours at a calm regular weight, with semibold reserved for product names inside the salt-pan grid.",
  "composition": "Hero on the deep olive-black inverse field #1c2414: on the left, cols 1–6 hold the Fraunces headline very large in #eef2ec, the lead below in Source Sans, then a single olive #4a5a1c call button; on the right, cols 7–12 hold the oil-shelf photo bled to the top and right page edges, full hero height, its lower-left corner cut on a diagonal. Directly beneath runs a full-width oil-yellow #d8c84a ribbon of short product words in dark #1c2414 Source Sans semibold, separated by small dots. 'Na policah' sits on the salt tint #f3f6f4: the heading and a short text span cols 1–4; cols 5–12 hold the salt-pan grid, a ruled grid of rectangular cells with 1px #c3cdc5 borders and uneven widths like the Sečovlje pans, each cell holding one offering name. The olive oil cell is the largest, filled with #4a5a1c and light text, and the salt cell is filled with #e6ece8. Gift section on pure #f3f6f4: the gift-box photo spans cols 1–7 and bleeds off the left edge; cols 8–12 hold 'Imamo tudi', the line of other goods, then two short blocks for darilni paket and poslovna darila, divided by a thin rule. Hours and place: the stone-entrance photo forms the section ground under a flat #1c2414 scrim at about 80%, with the hours table in cols 2–6 and, in cols 8–11, the address over a simple line map of the old town streets in #eef2ec. Contact on the salt tint: 'Naročila darilnih paketov' spans cols 1–6 with a click-and-collect sentence; cols 7–12 hold the phone as a huge Fraunces numeral in #1c2414, the e-mail address beneath, and no second button.",
  "imagery": "All four client photos are used and none are invented. The oil shelves are the hero, cropped to the bottle rows so the gold light dominates and the window is kept at the edge. The salt basket sits as a tall narrow crop inside one salt-pan cell area beside the grid, in cols 5–6 of the grid row. The gift box is a wide crop bled off the left edge. The stone entrance is the scrimmed ground of the hours section. The only drawn art is one small olive sprig in thin #4a5a1c ink line on a plain #f3f6f4 ground, placed beside the contact heading.",
  "signature": "The products laid out as a ruled grid of uneven salt-pan rectangles, with the oil cell flooded olive green, directly under the dark, glowing oil wall of the hero.",
  "copy": {
    "headline": "Olje, sol in dobrote manjših pridelovalcev iz Istre in s Krasa",
    "lead": "Majhna trgovina v starem mestnem jedru Kopra. Na policah so samo izdelki manjših pridelovalcev iz slovenske Istre in Krasa, darilne pakete pa sestavimo po vaši želji."
  },
  "imagePrompt": "One flat full-page screenshot of a desktop homepage, 1536×1024 px, with no browser window, no device frame and no perspective. It is a small Istrian delicatessen in Koper, built on a 12-column grid with generous margins. Hero: a full-width deep olive-black field #1c2414. Left half (cols 1–6): a very large upright semibold Fraunces serif headline in light #eef2ec, sentence case, no italics; below it a lead paragraph in Source Sans 3 regular, light; below that one rectangular olive button #4a5a1c with slightly rounded corners (not pill-shaped) and light text. Right half (cols 7–12): the attached photo of olive-oil bottle shelves, bled to the top and right edges at full hero height, its bottom-left corner cut off diagonally, the golden bottles glowing. Under the hero runs a full-width thin ribbon in oil yellow #d8c84a with a row of short product words in dark #1c2414 semibold sans separated by small dots. Next section on a very light cool grey-green ground #f3f6f4: at left (cols 1–4) a Fraunces heading in #1c2414 and a short paragraph in muted #55604c; at right (cols 5–12) a grid of ruled rectangles of uneven widths like salt evaporation pans, with 1px #c3cdc5 lines and each cell holding one product name in Source Sans semibold. The largest cell is filled olive #4a5a1c with light text, and one cell is filled pale #e6ece8. A tall narrow crop of the attached salt-bag basket photo sits in one cell. Next section on #f3f6f4: the attached gift-box photo spans cols 1–7 and bleeds off the left edge; at right (cols 8–12) a Fraunces heading, a line of text, a thin rule and two short text blocks. Next section: the attached stone shop entrance photo fills the full width under a flat dark #1c2414 scrim at about 80%; on it an opening-hours table in light #eef2ec sans at left (cols 2–6), and at right (cols 8–11) the address over a simple schematic line map of narrow old-town streets drawn in thin light lines. Last section on #f3f6f4: at left a Fraunces heading and short text; at right a huge Fraunces phone numeral in #1c2414 with the email address beneath. A small thin-line olive sprig drawing in #4a5a1c on the plain light ground sits beside the heading, apart from all text. Flat colours throughout, with no gradients, no shadows, no icons, no faces and no other photos."
}

